<td>[<b>68</b>] <font color=#006400><b>Chadock King ツアー Ⅱ</b></font></td>
<td width=10>　</td><td>投稿者：<font color=#0000FF><b>HanaC</b></font></td>
<td align=right>　<small>投稿日：2003/04/05(Sat) 21:49:17</small></td></tr></table>
<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="FF8040"><br>第2回EPICヘルプに参加していただいた方々　有難う御座いました。<br>結果は………？　SC安く済んでヨカッタ(゜▽゜*)<br><br>【1】Stained Cloth Mask<br>     MAGICITEM LOREITEM Slot:FACE<br>     Charge10<br>     AC:6 CHA: +4 HP:+20 MANA:+20<br>     SVD:+5 SVP:+5<br>     Effect:Ultravision<br>     WT:3.0 SMALL<br>     Class:ALL Race:ALL<br><br>【2】Argent Defender<br>     MAGICITEM Slot:PRIMARY<br>     2HS Atk Delay:49 DMG 33 <br>     MANA:+20<br>     WT:10.0 LARGE<br>     Class:WAR PAL RNG SHD Race:ALL<br><br>【3】Intricate Silver Rapier<br>     MAGICITEM Slot:PRIMARY SECONDARY<br>     Piercing Atk Delay:27 DMG 13 <br>     AC:5 CHA: +15<br>     WT:1.5 SMALL<br>     Class:WAR RNG BRD ROG Race:ALL<br><br>【4】spell:Acumen                SHM56 BST65<br>【5】spell Thrall of Bones       NEC54<br>【6】spell:Dementia              ENC54<br>【7】spell:Spirit of the storm   BST53<br><br>【8】The History of the Greenmist<br>    (IKS SHD no QuestItem desu)<br><br>***** ika LoY Spell  no moto  *****<br>【9】 words of Constancy<br>    ・Conjure Corpse (Necromancer 57)<br>    ・Infusion (Necromancer 55)<br>    ・Improved Invisibility to Undead (Cleric 50)<br>    ・Gangrenous Touch of Zum'uul (Necromancer 60)<br>【10】words of Holding<br>    ・Devouring Darkness (Necromancer 59)<br>    ・Bonds of Tunare (Druid 57)<br>【11】words of Asylum<br>    ・Dead Man Floating (Necromancer 44)<br>    ・Quivering Veil of Xarn (Necromancer 58)<br>    ・Shadowbond (Necromancer 54)<br>    ・Death Pact (Cleric 51)<br>【12】Toharon's Memoir Pg 22<br>    ・Wind of Tishanian (Enchanter 60)<br>    ・Divine Intervention (Cleric 60)<br>    ・Naltrons Mark (Cleric 58)<br>    ・Aegolism (Cleric 60)<br>    ・Protection of the Glades (Druid 60)<br><br>【13】Part of Yaeth's Compendium Pg97<br>     (nanno spell desyoukane?)<br><br>【14】残りのお金　538PP daa!!<br><br>1st needer は 【100-200】　その他は　【0-100】でよろ<br>期限は4/11 LoTT資格は参加者ONLYです(゜▽゜*)<br><br></font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
</font></td></tr></table>
