<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="000080"><br>[01]Shield of Battle<br>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  <br>Slot: SECONDARY  <br>AC: 13<br>STR: +2  WIS: +9  MANA: +10  <br>WT:  9.7    Size: GIANT<br>Class: WAR CLR PAL RNG SHD DRU BRD SHM <br>Race: ALL<br><br>[02]Hammer of Rage (2個)<br>MAGIC ITEM  <br>Slot: PRIMARY  <br>Skill: 2H Blunt  Atk Delay: 46<br>DMG: 30  <br>Effect: Yaulp (Combat)<br>WT:  7.3    Size: MEDIUM<br>Class: WAR CLR PAL RNG SHD SHM BST <br>Race: ALL<br><br>[03]Gauntlets of Iron Tactics<br>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  <br>Slot: HANDS  <br>AC: 2<br>STR: +7  DEX: +7  CHA: -5  WIS: +7  <br>WT:  1.0    Size: SMALL<br>Class: CLR DRU SHM <br>Race: ALL<br><br>[04]Silvery Belt of Contention<br>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  <br>Slot: WAIST  <br>AC: 10<br>STA: +4  WIS: +5  INT: +5  <br>Effect: Haste (Worn)<br>WT:  0.0    Size: TINY<br>Class: ALL<br>Race: ALL<br><br>以上5点です。<br>Lotto対象:参加された方<br>期限:24日中まで<br><br>一応、優先度ということで<br>１．1stで使用 当日Itemを未取得<br>２．1stで使用 Item取得<br>３．2nd以降 Item未取得<br>４．2nd以降 Item取得<br>こんな感じで書いてください。</font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
 <font color=#0000FF>[02] Telial：38</font><br>
 <font color=#0000FF>[02] Gengi：24</font><br>
