<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="FF8040"><br>EPICヘルプに参加していただいた方々　有難う御座いました。<br>結果は……（ｗ　　　チカジカ　再TRY予定ですのでまた宜しくお願い致します。<br><br>【1】Earring of Blazing Energy  MAGICITEM LOREITEM<br> slot : EAR <br> AC2 CHA+2 HP+35 MANA+35<br> effect: feedback  <br> WT0.3  <br> class: ENC <br> race : HUM ERU HIE EDF GNM<br><br>【2】Nathsar Gauntlets          MAGICITEM LOREITEM<br> slot : HANDS<br> AC8 DEX+4 WIS+4 SVC+2 SVM+2<br> WT:0.5  <br> class: WAR CLR PAL RNG SHD DRU MNK BRD ROG SHM BST<br> race : ALL<br><br>【3】Jade Inlaid Spaulders      MAGICITEM LOREITEM<br> slot : SHOULDERS<br> AC8 STA+5 INT+3 AGI+3 MANA+30 SVM+5<br> WT:2.2  <br> class: ALL <br> race : ALL<br><br>【4】Sarnak Arcane Fetish       LOREITEM<br> slot: NECK<br> DEX+2 CHA+5 INT+6<br> focus Effect: Enhancement haste II<br> class: ALL <br> race : ALL<br><br>【5】Spell  Word of Redernption    CLR60<br>【6】Spell  Trepidation            CLR57,NEC?,ENC?(gomen nasai w)<br><br>【7】Blue Diamond   x1<br><br>【8】Words of Viture   （LoYのSPELL材料　以下のSPELL元です）<br> Eye of Tallon (Magician 57)<br> Form of the Hunter (Druid 60)<br> Malosini (Shaman 57)<br> Mala (Magician 60)<br> Avatar (Shaman 60)<br> Transon's Elemental Renewal (Magician 60)<br> Ethereal Light (Cleric 58)<br> Maelstrom of Electricity (Magician 60)<br><br>【9】Yaeths Compendium Page 81 <br> Augment (Enchanter 56)<br> Succor (Druid 57)<br> Regrowth of Dah Khura (Shaman 56)<br> Marzin's Mark (Cleric 60)<br><br><br>SPELL元のDROPRATEは不明、ゴミかもシレナイ…ｗ<br><br>1st needer は 【100-200】　その他は　【0-100】でよろ<br>期限は3/21  LoTT資格は参加者ONLYです(゜▽゜*)<br> <br><br><br></font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
 <font color=#008000>[03] Ajyari：199</font><br>
 <font color=#008000>[03] Tamy：53</font><br>
 <font color=#008000>[03] Buchou：16</font><br>
 <font color=#8B008B>[04] Rinka@rog(Yone)：21</font><br>
 <font color=#FF00FF>[05] Nikuman：141</font><br>
