<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="000080"><br>Lotto資格は参加者の方<br>期限は1週間(27日中まで）とします。<br><br>[01]Snowchipper<br>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  <br>Slot: PRIMARY  SECONDARY  <br>Skill: 1H Slashing  Atk Delay: 20<br>DMG: 10  AC: 5<br>Skill Mod: Parry +3 %<br>STR: +5  DEX: +5  STA: +5  SV COLD: +10  <br>Required level of 51.<br>Effect: Frostcall (Combat)<br>WT:  4.0    Size: MEDIUM<br>Class: WAR PAL RNG SHD BRD ROG <br>Race: ALL<br><br>-<br><br>[02]Spiked Velium Mallet<br>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  <br>Slot: PRIMARY  SECONDARY  <br>Skill: 1H Blunt  Atk Delay: 20<br>DMG: 10  <br>Skill Mod: Block +3 %<br>STR: +5  DEX: +5  STA: +5  SV COLD: +10  <br>Required level of 51.<br>Effect: Frostcall (Combat)<br>WT:  1.0    Size: MEDIUM<br>Class: WAR CLR PAL RNG SHD DRU MNK BRD SHM <br>Race: ALL<br><br>-<br><br>[03]Tracking Wolf Collar<br>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  <br>Slot: NECK  <br>AC: 10<br>Skill Mod: Dodge +2 %<br>WIS: +5  INT: +5  HP: +40  MANA: +40  <br>SV COLD: +10  <br>Required level of 51.<br>WT:  1.0    Size: SMALL<br>Class: ALL<br>Race: ALL<br><br>謎Item..どちらもNonStat<br>[04]Words of Edification<br>[05]Staff Shard of Luclin</font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Selline：96</font><br>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Lendy：82</font><br>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Pasifica：69</font><br>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Buchou：50</font><br>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Pokko：38</font><br>
